{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 5930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1250, "text": "Previously on Night Court... Yet another\nwin for the prostitution!"}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 9610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 7350, "text": "Boy, it's like shooting fish in a\nbarrel."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 15130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 11190, "text": "Oscar's giving me the creeps. He gives\nme the crawls. He gives me the lust"}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 16130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 15130, "text": "bumps."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 22150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 16830, "text": "Matt, I'm telling you, Christine is head\nover heels in love with me."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 23790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 22790, "text": "And you?"}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 27930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 23970, "text": "Well, I love her, of course, but I'm not\nin love with her."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 29830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 28270, "text": "Rod, it's worse than I thought."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 32689, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 30670, "text": "Harriet head over heels in love with me."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 35230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 33190, "text": "Frank Pepitone, DA investigator."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 37610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 35870, "text": "I'm working on the fielding\ndisappearance."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 40110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 38370, "text": "Oh, don't bother. He's already\ndisappeared."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 44090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 42290, "text": "A warrant for his arrest?"}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 45990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 44950, "text": "What's the charge?"}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 51410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 46330, "text": "Embezzlement, fraud, and grand larceny\nto the sweet tune of 10 .2 mil."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 53690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 51710, "text": "Oh, yes, poor Dan."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 57170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 54990, "text": "Most of his friends think he's guilty."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 62810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 61610, "text": "What am I laughing at? I'm dead."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 66810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 65090, "text": "No, I'm not."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 73410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 67490, "text": "Now, I am the phantom of the courthouse."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 77970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 76310, "text": "The lovely Christine."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 83150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 78890, "text": "The time of the phantom is here."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 89410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 85050, "text": "The phantom's court is now in session."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 99100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 97100, "text": "Christine? Christine!"}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 100800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 99360, "text": "Where are you?"}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 109500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 108500, "text": "Dan!"}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 120040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 118160, "text": "So, Lizette."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 122128, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 121130, "text": "What's new?"}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 123130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 122130, "text": "Are you kidding?"}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 124690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 123330, "text": "Haven't you seen the paper?"}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 127150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 125390, "text": "Paisley's back, and Cirque has it."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 131850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 128150, "text": "I've had enough of your excuses. We have\nto find Christine Sullivan."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 137590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 133430, "text": "Look, Lisette, about last night... The\nmask ball?"}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 143430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 137930, "text": "Yeah. Well, you see, most of my first\ndates end in a restraining order."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 148770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 146150, "text": "So, before you have a chance to dump\nme..."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 238730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 235970, "text": "Anything? Sorry, Harry, nothing new to\nreport on Christine."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 240690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 239070, "text": "Oh, Mac, it's all my fault."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 243030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 240950, "text": "And just when I was ready to tell her\nthe truth."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 244970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 243290, "text": "You never told her how you really feel?"}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 247410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 245570, "text": "Now she's missing and she may never\nknow."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 249550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 248230, "text": "She may never know what?"}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 254610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 251250, "text": "Uh, the, uh, the real words to Louie\nLouie."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 258430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 257250, "text": "You guys find out anything?"}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 261570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 258930, "text": "Well, we searched every lady's room in\nthe entire building."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 265600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 261959, "text": "All we found was a can of hairspray,\nthree combs, and a pair of jockey"}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 268880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 266920, "text": "Wait a minute. I just thought of\nsomething."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 270400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 269400, "text": "Christine's missing."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 271620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 270620, "text": "Dan's missing."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 273340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 272340, "text": "Coincidence?"}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 275100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 273700, "text": "I think not."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 278020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 276560, "text": "It's a common thread."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 281640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 278920, "text": "Well, they worked side by side for seven\nyears."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 282900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 281900, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 286140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 283420, "text": "Their offices are right next to each\nother. No."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 288560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 287080, "text": "You're missing the obvious."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 292970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 289070, "text": "Dan and Christine share the same Chinese\nhand laundry on 13th Street."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 299910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 294790, "text": "If I were investigating this case, I'd\nbegin questioning one Mr. Wing Tip."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 304530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 301650, "text": "That's why you're not investigating this\ncase, lamp post."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 306710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 305590, "text": "Inspector Pepitone."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 307930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 306930, "text": "Judge Stone."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 310890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 308150, "text": "I happen to know who the phantom is."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 312610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 311290, "text": "It's Wing Tip, isn't it?"}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 314030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 313030, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 318210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 314870, "text": "It's Dan Fielding. You gotta be kidding.\nDan?"}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 319700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 318700, "text": "Why would you think that?"}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 321320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 320320, "text": "Deductive reasoning."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 324040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 321540, "text": "And because the Phantom dropped this\nwallet."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 330820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 325640, "text": "American Express. Dan Fielding.\nMasterCard. Dan Fielding. Video Vixen's"}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 333560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 332560, "text": "Sebastian's thighs."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 339960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 335640, "text": "Too bad. One more punch and he would\nhave gotten a free video and an"}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 340960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 339960, "text": "date."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 344380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 342180, "text": "How does this link him to the Phantom?"}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 345840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 344840, "text": "Simple."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 347500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 346500, "text": "Uh -oh."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 349640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 347740, "text": "He drew a mask on his driver's license\nplate."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 352560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 351000, "text": "Wait a minute, you guys."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 355240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 352960, "text": "I know Dan like I know me."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 358020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 355700, "text": "There's no way he's the Phantom."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 368400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 367060, "text": "I prepared your breakfast."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 370940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 369200, "text": "Crackers and Clamato juice."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 373260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 372060, "text": "I don't want crackers."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 376900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 373580, "text": "I don't want Clamato juice. I told you\nall night, I just want to go home."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 379520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 377799, "text": "It's Clamato juice."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 384460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 380760, "text": "I told you all night, you can't. We've\ngot too many things to do."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 387200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 385020, "text": "Okay, what are we going to do? Gather\nstring?"}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 392180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 389600, "text": "It's not nice to mock the Phantom."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 394420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 393420, "text": "Dan!"}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 395780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 394780, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 402420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 397560, "text": "Your job is to defend the evildoers. Oh,\nanyone particular in mind?"}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 403680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 402680, "text": "Yes, Will Sanders."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 406080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 404020, "text": "The evil man who destroyed the Phil\nFoundation."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 411480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 406800, "text": "Now, here's the plan. In absentia, we\nwill prosecute Will. You'll put up a"}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 414500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 411480, "text": "terrific argument in his defense, but at\nthe end, I'll win."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 416700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 415700, "text": "Pretty sure of yourself."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 418640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 417160, "text": "Don't forget to mention I'm the judge,\ntoo."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 421440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 420440, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 422540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 421540, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 423760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 422760, "text": "Enough is enough."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 427420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 424340, "text": "Much as I would love to say I have a two\no 'clock appointment with reality."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 428740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 427740, "text": "See ya."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 430500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 429500, "text": "You'll find it locked."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 432580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 431580, "text": "And I have the key."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 435100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 433680, "text": "Hidden in a secret place."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 441920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 438820, "text": "Dan Fielding, if this is all an\nelaborate plan to get me to search"}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 443140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 441920, "text": "pants, I will never forgive you."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 446520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 444440, "text": "You see, get your mind out of the sewer."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 448060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 446840, "text": "We are in the sewer."}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 451540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 448520, "text": "No, actually, we're in the sub -sub\n-basement. The sewer's above us."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 453920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 452160, "text": "Dan, you need help."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 455520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 454520, "text": "You're right."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 456540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 455540, "text": "Help me with this."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 466320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 462960, "text": "that picture? One of these tunnels leads\nright to a photo mat."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 471860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 469640, "text": "This is crazy."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 473320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 472320, "text": "No, Christine."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 475680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 473500, "text": "This is my new reality."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 479220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 476760, "text": "Now, I gave. I cared. I changed."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 483940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 479900, "text": "What did it get me? I ain't being hunted\nlike a wild animal. So don't call me"}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 484940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 483940, "text": "crazy."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 486860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 485320, "text": "A little defensive, maybe."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 490940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 488380, "text": "Please, enough of this chit -chat. Let\nus get on with the first case."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 494200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 491380, "text": "Dan, I insist you stop this foolishness\nand come with me. No."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 496680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 495440, "text": "I'm a wanted man, remember?"}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 500960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 498220, "text": "Besides, I like it down here. When I\nsing doo -wop, there's a great echo."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 504700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 502860, "text": "Dan, I'm begging you."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 506920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 505500, "text": "Please, let me go."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 510720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 507620, "text": "You can't help down here. The only\nchange you can make is up there."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 512299, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 511300, "text": "Come on."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 513740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 512740, "text": "Let's go."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 516559, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 515559, "text": "No, Christine."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 524290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 518409, "text": "My destiny lies down here now, amongst\nthe shadows and the rats."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 532770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 530650, "text": "Go, fair Christine, go."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 535550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 533930, "text": "You'll find the key in my pants."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 539370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 538370, "text": "Dan!"}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 542050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 540350, "text": "The pair hanging by the door."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 561590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 559310, "text": "Well, let me know if you hear anything.\nThank you."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 565270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 564270, "text": "Knock, knock."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 569110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 567270, "text": "What can I do for you, Counselor?"}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 574790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 569330, "text": "Well, Your Honor, I'm considering\ngetting Lizette a little tipsy after"}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 580010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 574870, "text": "driving her to Maryland, and getting\nmarried before the buzz wears off."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 582310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 581230, "text": "What do you think?"}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 585210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 582750, "text": "A ripple wine or a malt liquor?"}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 589180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 587880, "text": "You can't do that."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 594000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 589500, "text": "Why not? My father did it to my mother.\nIt's a family tradition, Harry."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 597100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 594300, "text": "Go away and don't call me Harry."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 601080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 599680, "text": "What a day."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 602700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 601660, "text": "Sure was."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 605400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 604040, "text": "Christine! Harry."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 607060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 605760, "text": "Oh. Oh."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 615800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 608940, "text": "I thought I'd never see you again and\nyou're back."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 616820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 615820, "text": "I'm back forever."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 623730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 620270, "text": "you so much. I missed you so much, too.\nI had a lot of time to think about us. I"}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 625390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 623730, "text": "had a lot of time to think about us,\ntoo. And?"}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 627970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 626230, "text": "I want to be just friends. I don't want\nto be your girlfriend."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 634430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 630530, "text": "Oh, Christine, you've made me the\nhappiest man in the world."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 637130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 635570, "text": "I don't want to be your boyfriend."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 639970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 638350, "text": "What could we have been thinking?"}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 642850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 640550, "text": "I don't know. I guess we were just young\nand foolish."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 648090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 644710, "text": "Christine, I like you."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 651390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 650350, "text": "like you."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 660190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 656130, "text": "Excuse me, Your Honor. We were going to\nget some of my ocean food. Hey, look,"}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 661950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 660270, "text": "everybody. Blondie's back."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 665230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 664230, "text": "Oh, hi."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 667670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 665730, "text": "So where the hell have you been?"}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 669770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 667950, "text": "In hell with Dan."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 671750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 670410, "text": "She never thought to look there."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 678050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 674630, "text": "Guys, he really needs our help. He's the\nPhantom."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 679610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 678270, "text": "I've been in his lair."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 683720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 680080, "text": "His lair? What are you talking about?\nIt's in the sub -sub -basement. Come on,"}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 684720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 683720, "text": "we don't have any time to lose."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 689300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 685760, "text": "Lizette, listen, no matter what happens\ntonight, promise me you won't drive to"}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 690300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 689300, "text": "Maryland."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 697200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 695120, "text": "The sub -sub -basement, huh?"}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 699300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 698300, "text": "Thanks, Blondie."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 709240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 704900, "text": "Okay, Macaroon, what's next in our\ncavalcade of justice?"}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 713320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 712200, "text": "I think you'll like, sir."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 719120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 714440, "text": "People versus Smith. Breaking and\nentering and stealing from good,"}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 720120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 719120, "text": "people."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 722320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 721320, "text": "Prosecution?"}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 727380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 726200, "text": "Guilty as sin, Your Honor."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 732300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 728540, "text": "Unless the able defense attorney has\nsome evidence that we don't know about."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 736240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 735240, "text": "Your Honor."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 741040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 738700, "text": "I find the defendant..."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 746430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 741370, "text": "Totally defenseless and yield to the\nwise and devastatingly handsome"}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 752810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 751630, "text": "I knew it."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 755590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 753270, "text": "I knew she always had the hots for Dan."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 759430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 757930, "text": "Dan, the hot?"}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 763390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 760270, "text": "You're the one standing next to the\nfurnace."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 766810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 765270, "text": "Try to keep up, did we?"}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 769450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 768450, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 773720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 772720, "text": "focus, people."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 779100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 774680, "text": "Mr. Smith, I have no choice but to find\nyou guilty and charge you with the usual"}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 781980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 779100, "text": "$50 in time served and death by firing\nsquad."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 787080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 786080, "text": "Dan."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 790600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 789600, "text": "How'd you do that?"}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 793620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 792140, "text": "Dan, we're here to help you."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 814480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 813100, "text": "They must have followed us."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 816360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 814760, "text": "Good guess, buttercup."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 820360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 817320, "text": "Now Fielding is headed straight for the\nHooskow."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 827060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 821940, "text": "Great to have you back, Dan."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 835200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 830300, "text": "So, what do you say after session we\ntake a little drive to Maryland?"}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 840240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 835920, "text": "You, me, and a bottle of peppermint\nschnapps."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 845040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 842800, "text": "Is the next case what I think it is?\nYeah."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 850840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 845700, "text": "People versus Daniel Fielding.\nEmbezzlement, fraud, and grand larceny."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 863520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 857040, "text": "Prosecution? Your Honor, everybody's All\n-American here stole"}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 868600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 863520, "text": "10 .2 million simoleons from the Phil\nFoundation."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 871400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 869220, "text": "The people want..."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 877040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 876040, "text": "my case."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 880880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 878020, "text": "I'd like to rest my knuckles on your\nface, you little troll."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 887780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 882880, "text": "Defense. Your Honor, my client pleads\ntemporary insanity due to the obvious"}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 888780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 887780, "text": "reasons."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 890240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 889240, "text": "But why?"}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 893640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 890400, "text": "I think he looks good dressed as the\nPhantom."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 900900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 896140, "text": "Wait a minute. Hold it. Your Honor, um,\nI would like to withdraw the plea of"}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 904240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 900900, "text": "temporary insanity. I'm not insane. I\nnever was insane."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 906480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 905480, "text": "I'm guilty."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 908120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 906800, "text": "Dan, you're pleading guilty?"}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 913780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 912260, "text": "Held over for sentencing."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 917600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 914580, "text": "Bull, take the prisoner to holding."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 927800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 925480, "text": "Okay, this is my final offer."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 934460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 928820, "text": "The schnapps, a pizza, and a Series E\nsavings bond."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 955780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 954540, "text": "the inner crevices of my cranium."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 959300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 958240, "text": "I'm guilty, Bull."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 961860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 960860, "text": "Fire away."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 965480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 964360, "text": "Rats, you called my bluff."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 968120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 967120, "text": "Come on, let's sit down."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 975600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 969140, "text": "I just want to let you know that I\nreally appreciate the faith you have in"}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 977040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 975660, "text": "At this moment, it means a lot."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 980820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 978120, "text": "If it means so much to you, why don't\nyou tell me the truth?"}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 984190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 982990, "text": "I think I deserve it."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 988050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 986850, "text": "You're right. You do."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 992270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 988810, "text": "The truth is, I didn't steal a dime."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 994370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 993230, "text": "Then why do you want to go to jail?"}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 997630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 995530, "text": "Because a piano fell on a bum named\nPhil."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 1000530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 998870, "text": "Well, that wasn't your fault, Dan."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 1004410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1000890, "text": "No, I know it, but if Phil hadn't died,\nI could have gone on living my life my"}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 1005410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1004410, "text": "way."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 1008810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1006050, "text": "I wouldn't have had to bother with\nfeeding the poor, clothing the naked,"}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 1010530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1008810, "text": "others before me."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 1012650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1011470, "text": "But you're not guilty."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 1014050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1012890, "text": "I am guilty."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 1016970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1014290, "text": "Phil put his trust in me, and I blew it."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 1019070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1017810, "text": "I deserve to be punished."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 1021290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1019830, "text": "Then I'm going to prison with you."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 1027970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1024069, "text": "My dear friend, you don't have to do\nthat."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 1029450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1028450, "text": "Oh, yes, I do."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 1031290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1029990, "text": "I lost the key to the cops."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 1034810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1033810, "text": "I've got a key."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 1036730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1035470, "text": "We heard the whole thing."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 1038569, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1037369, "text": "Pretty doofy, huh?"}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 1040150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1039150, "text": "Some of it."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 1041299, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1040300, "text": "Why the costume?"}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 1043560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1041300, "text": "Well, I thought it would be dramatic."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 1045380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1044280, "text": "Why the phantom?"}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 1048740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1045960, "text": "What, I'm going to scare somebody\ndressed like Miss Saigon, right?"}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1052180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1051000, "text": "Would have scared me."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1055480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1053560, "text": "Dan, this is all very simple."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1058880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1055800, "text": "You're the victim. You didn't steal\nanything from anybody."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1060720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1059180, "text": "Change your plea to not guilty."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1063940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1061080, "text": "We'll get you some psychiatric\ncounseling and you'll be good as new."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1066260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1064760, "text": "Thank you, little Harry Sunshine."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1070530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1069120, "text": "No. It's jail time."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1074490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1071030, "text": "Why? Because I'd let everyone down."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1078430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1075790, "text": "That money was for the needy. It never\ngot to them because of me."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1081610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1079890, "text": "I had a responsibility. I blew it."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1089390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1083290, "text": "Now I'll spend a lot of time in a cell\nwith a guy named Bobo to think about it."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1096910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1091550, "text": "Hey, wait a minute. What is it? You'll\nnot serve a minute, my friend."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1100460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1097500, "text": "You're a good man with a good heart.\nCome with me."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1102240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1101040, "text": "Mac, hit the light. Oh."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1105720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1104060, "text": "You know, you're going to get hurt doing\nthat."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1110700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1108320, "text": "Whoops. Hey, everyone, have you heard?"}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1112140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1111140, "text": "Fielding has escaped."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1115060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1113860, "text": "Fielding, you."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1118120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1116460, "text": "You're under arrest again."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1121360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1118680, "text": "Hey, wait a minute."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1123720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1122300, "text": "Fielding, Phantom, Fielding."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1126060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1125060, "text": "What's going on here?"}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1130550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1127150, "text": "I'd love to explain, Inspector, but the\nsecond phantom really throws me."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1134550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1133490, "text": "Maybe I could help."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1139370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1138370, "text": "Will?"}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1141150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1139650, "text": "Kill! Wait, Dan, wait!"}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1143590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1141470, "text": "Let me try to explain this whole thing."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1151910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1146490, "text": "When I first met this man, he had sucker\nwritten all over him. Well, thanks for"}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1152910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1151910, "text": "straightening that out."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1154690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1153450, "text": "Now prepare to die!"}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1161150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1154990, "text": "Yes! I had a simple plan for gaining his\nconfidence by sharing in his do"}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1162570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1161150, "text": "-gooding mumbo -jumbo."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1165150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1163010, "text": "So you took the money. It was easy."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1169990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1165590, "text": "I wrote myself a check for 10 .2 million\nand exited stage left."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1175050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1170390, "text": "And, as always, they returned to the\nscene of the crime. Only because..."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1181030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1175050, "text": "Some of Dan's mumbo -jumbo really\ntouched my heart."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1183830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1182530, "text": "I'm sorry, Dan."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1190140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1185920, "text": "Well, Fielding, it looks like you're a\nfree man."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1194840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1191860, "text": "Will Sanders, you're under arrest."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1198900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1195100, "text": "No, Dan, one other piece of unfinished\nbusiness."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1205980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1203520, "text": "The money, it's all here."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1210020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1206380, "text": "Matter of fact, it's half a million\nmore. I invested it in a high -interest"}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1211020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1210020, "text": "account."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1213700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1212620, "text": "What can I say?"}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1215260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1214200, "text": "I've got a knack."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1219800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1217860, "text": "Well, you can take me away, Inspector."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1224040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1223040, "text": "Wait."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1230840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1226080, "text": "Will, I touched your heart. I made a\ndifference in your life."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1232600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1231300, "text": "I've returned, haven't I?"}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1234820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1233640, "text": "Inspector, release that man."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1237100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1235760, "text": "I'm not pressing any charges."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1243300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1239000, "text": "Judge, you gave back the money. I'd say\nyou don't have a case."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1246100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1245100, "text": "Well..."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1249000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1246280, "text": "Maybe this gumshoe racket isn't for me."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1254560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1250120, "text": "I've always had a hankering to go out\nwest and sell patio furniture."}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1260780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1258100, "text": "Harry, take this check. I'm no good at\nthe do -gooding."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1262720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1261100, "text": "No, I wouldn't be too sure of that."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1266060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1263020, "text": "No, please, here, you're a judge. Find a\ncourt that'll appoint a new head to the"}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1267060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1266060, "text": "Phil Foundation."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1270620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1268580, "text": "I want to go clean up and take about a\ntwo -week nap."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1275220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1273960, "text": "Keep the faith, baby."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1278980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1277980, "text": "Look, Dan."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1283060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1281100, "text": "I don't want to lead a selfish life."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1287520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1284280, "text": "I wish to serve humanity."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1290560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1289560, "text": "That's very noble."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1293880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1291540, "text": "You can start by drawing my bath."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1296240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1295240, "text": "Bubble?"}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1308650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1305930, "text": "I got two tickets for the team table\ntennis tournament tonight."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1310070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1309070, "text": "You want to go?"}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1311830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1310830, "text": "Team table tennis?"}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1314470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1312170, "text": "That sounds really boring."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1318630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1315730, "text": "Since we're not dating anymore, I can\nsay no, so no."}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1322670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1320210, "text": "Isn't it great being friends again? We\ncan say no."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1332330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1326110, "text": "Your Honor, it's with deep regrets I\ntender my resignation as your"}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1333330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1332330, "text": "attorney."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1339010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1333370, "text": "Oh? You are looking at the new court\n-appointed executor of the Phil"}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1343330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1340550, "text": "Yeah, it's a perfect job for me."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1345650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1343770, "text": "Suffering is my middle name."}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1351630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1348130, "text": "Oh, wait up, Lisette. I'll hold the\nelevator for you."}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1355490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1354490, "text": "Sturdy gal."}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1357510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1355690, "text": "She'll make a great breeder."}
